d, exits in third quarter of win over Florida State","description":"In the regular-season finale for both teams, Florida quarterback Aaron Philo was knocked out of the Gators' contest against the Florida State Seminoles in the third quarter after taking a hard hit following a run, and he was replaced by Tramell Jones Jr.","published":"2026-11-28T00:07:35.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50616023/injured-florida-quarterback-aaron-philo-exits-3rd-quarter","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Andrea Adelson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Akron coach Joe Moorhead resigns after 5 seasons to pursue other opportunities","description":"Akron head coach Joe Moorhead is stepping down after five seasons with the Zips to pursue other opportunities, he announced Friday.","published":"2026-11-27T21:03:06.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50614041/akron-coach-joe-moorhead-resigns-pursue-other-opportunities","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Who are the winningest college football coaches of all time?","description":"From Saban to Paterno, there are many legendary college football coaches. Who has the best career record? Check out who has the most wins now.","published":"2026-11-27T20:18:28.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/39283806/who-winningest-college-football-coaches-all","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Rivalry Week live: Top plays and playoff analysis","description":"It's the final week of the regular season. Here are the best plays, moments and CFP implications.","published":"2026-11-27T20:37:42.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50596213/rivalry-week-live-cfp-takeaways","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2026 'College GameDay' Week 13: Duke vs. Wake Forest","description":"\"College GameDay\" heads to Wake Forest University for Week 13.","published":"2026-11-27T17:21:43.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50612493/2026-college-gameday-week-13-duke-vs-wake-forest","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"How every 2027 five-star college football prospect will fit","description":"There are 23 five-star players in the class, and we scout each one's game for the next level.","published":"2026-11-27T17:00:30.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/recruiting/story/_/id/48543549/college-football-recruiting-2027-prospects-five-star-scouts-take","type":"Story","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Which teams have the best odds to make the College Football Playoff?","description":"We are tracking the odds for making the CFP, earning a bye and winning it all.","published":"2026-11-27T15:51:28.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532919/college-football-playoff-odds-predictions","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Houston, rivalry color rushes lead top uniforms of CFB Week 13","description":"Just because it's rivalry week doesn't mean teams still can't put their best foot forward with uniform swag.","published":"2026-11-27T15:00:13.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50598211/college-football-uniforms-week-13-houston","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What the world looked like the last time Texas A&M beat Texas","description":"It has been 15 years since Texas A&M came out on top on the gridiron against its rivals to the southwest.","published":"2026-11-27T17:36:28.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/47109982/texas-aggies-lone-star-showdown-last-win-2010","type":"Story","byline":"J.J. Post","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5229444/tj-dottery","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TJ_Dottery"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"TJ Dottery","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TJ_Dottery","description":"American football player (born 2003)","touched":"2026-11-25T17:07:22Z","intro":"TJ Dottery (born TJ Dudley; December 22, 2003) is an American college football linebacker for the LSU Tigers. He previously played for the Clemson Tigers and Ole Miss Rebels.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"TJ Dottery was born on December 22, 2003, as TJ Dudley. Dudley attended Montgomery Catholic Preparatory School in Montgomery, Alabama. Over the course of his high school career, he recorded 381 tackles, 10.5 sacks, and seven interceptions. A four-star recruit, Dudley committed to play college football at Clemson University over offers from Florida, LSU, and Oregon."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Dudley earned a redshirt in 2022 after appearing in four games and recording two tackles. In July 2023, he was dismissed from Clemson's football team for violating team rules and subsequently entered the transfer portal.\nOn July 28, 2023, Dudley announced his decision to transfer to the University of Mississippi to play for the Ole Miss Rebels. Due to NCAA transfer rules, Dudley was ineligible to play during the 2023 regular season but was granted eligibility for the 2023 Peach Bowl, where he recorded two tackles in his Ole Miss debut.\nOn January 16, 2026, Dottery announced his decision to transfer to Louisiana State University to play for the LSU Tigers, following head coach Lane Kiffin."}]}}